---
description: Standards for x402 backend integration and the Coinbase CDP SDK
globs: src/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
- Always use Node.js and TypeScript for backend routing.
- Use `@coinbase/cdp-sdk` for all x402 discovery and wallet functions.
- Use the `fetchWithPayment` utility from `x402-fetch` to handle HTTP 402 responses automatically.
- Do not manually construct HTTP 402 retry loops; always rely on the SDK middleware.
- Reference canonical examples from the `@coinbase/cdp-sdk` documentation rather than guessing implementations.